UPDATE companies SET description='Jackson Solar LLC operates from Jackson, Missouri. The company is led by Jacob Long, a certified electrician and NABCEP‑certified professional with a bachelor’s degree in sustainable energy systems and an associate degree in electrochemistry, together with business partner Dylan Kaminskey, who also holds an associate degree in electrochemistry. The firm is locally owned and operated, established to bring transparent, ethical solar installations to Southeast Missouri.

The firm designs and installs residential and commercial photovoltaic systems, integrating equipment from brands such as SolarEdge, Enphase, Generac, REC, and Q‑Cell. Services include free consultation and system design, battery backup installation, system monitoring via Sense Solar, ongoing maintenance and repair, and $0‑down financing options. To date, the team has completed hundreds of installations across the region.

