UPDATE companies SET description='James & James Furniture was founded in 2011 in a small garage in Springdale, Arkansas, and now operates from Heber Springs in the same state. The company began as a weekend project building a single handcrafted table, which grew into a full-time commitment to solid hardwood furniture. No founders are named in the source material, and ownership structure is not disclosed.

The company designs and builds custom made-to-order furniture for dining rooms, bedrooms, living rooms, and offices. Every piece is crafted from solid American hardwoods — no veneer or particle board — in its Arkansas woodshop. Production combines in-house joinery and hand-applied finishes with long-standing partnerships with Amish and Mennonite woodworkers who produce chairs and select bed frames to the same standards. The operation is made-to-order, allowing customers to specify dimensions, wood species, finish, and configuration.

James & James serves residential buyers directly and supports the interior-design trade through a dedicated program that offers complimentary samples, exclusive pricing, and a specialist for product recommendations, lead times, and quotes.

