UPDATE companies SET description='Jireh Semiconductor, Inc. operates as the in-house wafer fabrication facility for Alpha and Omega Semiconductor (AOS) in Hillsboro, Oregon. Established as a wholly owned subsidiary of the NASDAQ-listed power semiconductor company (ticker: AOSL), the fab supports AOS’s vertical integration strategy. AOS was founded by Dr. Mike F. Chang, who serves as Chairman and Executive Vice President of Strategic Initiatives.

