UPDATE companies SET description='Kemin Industries Inc is headquartered in Des Moines, Iowa. The company was founded in 1961 by husband-and-wife duo R.W. and Mary Nelson, who started the business from their home.

Kemin operates more than 15 manufacturing facilities worldwide and offers a portfolio of over 500 specialty ingredients. Its core activities include ingredient manufacturing for animal nutrition and health, animal vaccines, food technologies, human nutrition and health, and pet food and rendering. Beyond production, the company provides Customer Laboratory Services (CLS) for product testing, Kemin Application Solutions (KAS) for equipment installation and training, Technical Services for troubleshooting, Research and Exploration Services (RES) for early-stage innovation, and the sciORIAN™ digital platform for operations management.

The company serves customers in more than 120 countries across industries such as livestock production, pet food manufacturing, rendering, food processing, and human dietary supplements. Its client base includes pet food companies, renderers, ingredient suppliers, veterinarians, and food manufacturers seeking oxidation control, food safety, palatability enhancement, and nutritional solutions.

Kemin states that it is driven by curiosity and a commitment to science-based innovation, aiming to transform quality of life for people, pets, and animals. The company emphasizes a “Partnership Beyond Ingredients” model, delivering tailored services — from lab analysis to application engineering — to help customers maximize the value of its ingredients.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Ingredient manufacturing", "Customer Laboratory Services (CLS)", "Kemin Application Solutions (KAS)", "Technical Services", "Research and Exploration Services (RES)", "sciORIAN\u2122 digital operations software", "Oxidation control solutions", "Food safety solutions", "Palatability enhancement", "Health and nutrition formulation"], "industries": ["Animal Nutrition & Health", "Animal Vaccines", "Food Technologies", "Human Nutrition & Health", "Pet Food & Rendering", "Pet Food Manufacturing", "Rendering"], "materials": ["Plant-based ingredients", "Natural ingredients", "Specialty ingredients"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["15+ manufacturing facilities worldwide", "500+ specialty ingredients in portfolio", "Customer Laboratory Services (CLS) for dedicated analytical support", "Kemin Application Solutions (KAS) for equipment design, installation, and training", "Technical Services team for shelf-life, flavor, and nutrition troubleshooting"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1961 by R.W. and Mary Nelson -> description (db)", "Headquartered in Des Moines, Iowa -> db (hq_city, hq_state_label)", "More than 15 manufacturing facilities worldwide -> page ''/''", "Operates in more than 90 countries -> page ''/''", "Customers in more than 120 countries -> page ''/''", "Offers more than 500 specialty ingredients -> page ''/''", "Industries: Animal Nutrition & Health, Animal Vaccines, Food Technologies, Human Nutrition & Health, Pet Food & Rendering -> page ''/''", "Services: Customer Laboratory Services, Kemin Application So